Increase if necessary by 2.5 mg at weekly intervals (max. 0.4-0.5 mg/
kg 8 hourly)
Note 10-9
Discontinue if there is no response after a month
 
Referral Criteria 
All suspected cases of autism should be referred to a Tertiary centre.'),
