yy
Lichen planus
yy
Bullous pemphigoid
Generalised pruritus (usually due to a systemic disease)
yy
Haematological e.g. iron deficiency anaemia, polycythaemia rubra 
vera, lymphomas, leukaemias
yy
Liver disease e.g. intrahepatic or extrahepatic cholestasis, primary 
biliary cirrhosis, hepatitis
yy
Chronic kidney disease
yy
Thyroid disease
yy
Pregnancy
yy
Diabetes mellitus
yy
Carcinomas 
