Viral infections e.g. herpes simplex virus, retrovirus, cytomegalovirus
yy
Mycoplasma pnuemoniae infection
yy
Adverse drug reaction e.g. to sulphonamides, penicillin, NSAIDS, 
anticonvulsants etc.
