25 kg); 500 micrograms stat. 1 month-8 years; 500 micrograms stat. Neonate; 20 microgram/kg stat.',NULL,'— Treatment-Induced Hypoglycaemia —
Standard Treatment Guidelines, 7th Edition, 2017
