A glass of milk or fruit drink and a tablespoonful of honey are 
useful alternatives
yy
The above measures should be followed immediately by a meal 
or snack
yy
Moderate hypoglycaemia
yy
Same as for mild hypoglycaemia, but repeat after 10 minutes. If 
no improvement is observed, treat as for severe hypoglycaemia
Pharmacological treatment 
