(See appropriate sections) and refer patient for definitive treatment.
Note 12-9
Do not withdraw corticosteroids suddenly in patients with Cushing’s syndrome 
due to corticosteroid abuse or prolonged use. Instead, the dose must be ta­
pered off slowly over several weeks and months to prevent acute adrenal insuf­
